2026-11-01T07:38:34.4085529Z CAUGHT             C29 a lease is never checked, so a preempted agent keeps typing
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4086400Z CAUGHT             C29 the owner takes control back and the agent does not notice
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4087070Z CAUGHT             C29 one service may use another's lease
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4087652Z CAUGHT             C29 mTLS says who, and then nothing says what
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4088269Z CAUGHT             C29 an observe-only task may actuate
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4088830Z CAUGHT             C29 a task that has gone wrong runs forever
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4089497Z CAUGHT             C29 the budget is never spent, which is the same as not having one
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4090516Z CAUGHT             C29 file:/// reads the host's disk into a page the owner is watching
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4091266Z CAUGHT             C29 the CDP client may be pointed at another host's browser
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4092032Z CAUGHT             C29 a hostname is accepted, and resolves on a machine we do not control
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4092865Z CAUGHT             C31 a caller names itself in the body and the certificate stops mattering
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4093588Z CAUGHT             C31 a caller sends its own scope and budget
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4094256Z CAUGHT             C31 a message from a different protocol version is decoded anyway
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4094963Z CAUGHT             C31 lease_generation true passes the fencing check
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4095672Z CAUGHT             C32 the input router grows a second CDP surface
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4096385Z CAUGHT             C29 the only bridge to Chromium binds to the internet
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4097114Z CAUGHT             C29 the control agent binds to a public address
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4098295Z CAUGHT             C29 a caller with no client certificate completes the handshake
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4099295Z CAUGHT             C29 a packet built against the previous layout is transformed rather than refused
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4100400Z CAUGHT             C29 a preempted agent's input still reaches the page
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4101248Z CAUGHT             C29 a press without a move, so a hover-dependent page is clicked in the wrong place
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4102068Z CAUGHT             C29 a drag reports no button held, and ends halfway through
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4102860Z CAUGHT             C29 a cancel is dropped, leaving the page holding a press
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4103626Z CAUGHT             C29 a printable key fires an event and types nothing
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4104415Z CAUGHT             C29 a scroll is a fixed pixel count, whatever the viewport is
2026-11-01T07:38:34.4105242Z CAUGHT             C29 an unmapped kind is silently treated as a pointer move
